ongruence relation to its underlying binary relation. -/]\ninstance : FunLike (Con M) M (M → Prop) where\n  coe c := c.r\n  coe_injective' x y h := by\n    rcases x with ⟨⟨x, _⟩, _⟩\n    rcases y with ⟨⟨y, _⟩, _⟩\n    have : x = y := h\n    subst x; rfl","start":122,"end":131},"axioms":[]}